  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_calendars_cb127c89d5797c0160166f8bc47b228dff0ce4afd5aad5f08604d69053d8447063">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>a table or chart of the year, or for a mathematical or astronomical table (MED s.v. calender n.) | case for a table or chart of the year, or for a mathematical or astronomical table (MED s.v. calender n.) | calendar, a table showing the division of a given year into its months and days, and referring the days of each month to the days of the week; often also including important astronomical data, and indicating ecclesiastical or other festivals, and other events belonging to individual days (OED s.v. calendar n. 2) | a written calender; an astronomical table (MED s.v. calender) | a table (or pamphlet) showing the division of the year into months and days, often with astronomical data and/or church festivals (notably Easter) and saints’ days (OED s.v. calendar n.)</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
    <crm:P2_has_type rdf:resource="http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E33_Linguistic_Object"/>
  </rdf:Description>
